        "overlay/src/cryptanalysis/ecbench/retained_attempt_join.rs:18-69",
        "overlay/src/cryptanalysis/ecbench/retained_attempt_join.rs:123-203"
      ],
      "evidence": "The CLI never invokes checked_file or parses referenced evidence. raw_costs is an unconstrained JSON Value, while eligible_for_pair is accepted from the request after shallow presence/status checks.",
      "impact": "Synthetic pins and null costs can be serialized as an eligible cohort without re-establishing custody, stream completeness, resource/process/controller consistency, or scientific/cost gates.",
      "required_correction": "Bind a validated retained-session/custody output or re-open, hash, parse, and cross-check every input and recompute eligibility before export."
